# Episode 3: The Form

INT. AAROGYA RECEPTION - NIGHT (SEVEN MONTHS AGO)

SUPER: "7 MONTHS AGO"

Fluorescent glare. ARJUN VARMA (31), crisp shirt, two phones, fills in a form at the counter.

Behind him, MEERA, feverish, is slumped in a wheelchair, whispering into her phone.

MEERA
(barely audible)
Karthik... నాకు భయంగా ఉంది...

Arjun's pen stops at "EMERGENCY CONTACT".

INT. AAROGYA WARD - DAWN (SEVEN MONTHS AGO)

Through the ward's glass panel, Arjun watches. KARTHIK arrives with an idli parcel and a phone charger. Meera, grey with fever, lights up.

Arjun looks down at the form. He writes a number. Slowly.

INT. KARTHIK'S CAR - DAY

SUPER: "NOW"

Rain. Wipers. Meera in the passenger seat, the folded form in her lap. Karthik hums along to a track on the stereo.

MEERA
ఇది ఎవరిది?

KARTHIK
నేనే mix చేశా. Ad jingle. Client కి నచ్చలేదు.

MEERA
నాకు నచ్చింది.

He glances at her and smiles. She almost unfolds the form. She doesn't.

INT. MEERA'S BUILDING, STAIRWELL - DAY

A paper sign on the lift reads "OUT OF ORDER". Karthik carries her bag up the stairs. She reaches for it.

MEERA
ఇవ్వు, నేను తీసుకెళ్తా.

KARTHIK
ఒక్క చేత్తోనా? నాలుగో floor కి?

MEERA
నేను ఒక్కదాన్నే manage చేసుకుంటా. ఎప్పుడూ చేసుకున్నా కదా.

KARTHIK
తెలుసు. అందుకే ఇవ్వను.

INT. MEERA'S DOORWAY - CONTINUOUS

Fourth floor. Both are breathless, standing close. Rain sounds through the stairwell grille.

MEERA
Karthik.
(beat)
నేను నీకు ఏమవుతాను?

He holds her gaze. Too long. Then he looks down at the bag as he sets it down.

KARTHIK
Rest తీసుకో. Tablets టైంకి వేసుకుంటే చాలు.

He goes down the stairs. She listens to his footsteps fade.

INT. MEERA'S FLAT - CONTINUOUS

She shuts the door and leans on it.

Her phone lights up: "Arjun".

ON SCREEN: "Accident gurinchi vinnanu. Are you okay? Can we meet?"
